 full undergraduate degree"}],[["$","p","A first-year award is not automatically a four-year funding plan. In a fictional shortlist, one university offers a renewable tuition reduction and another assesses need each year. Comparing only the first award amount hides the different risks after enrolment.",{"children":"A first-year award is not automatically a four-year funding plan. In a fictional shortlist, one university offers a renewable tuition reduction and another assesses need each year. Comparing only the first award amount hides the different risks after enrolment."}],["$","p","Read the duration and renewal clause in each issued decision. Record credit load, academic progress, annual financial reassessment or any other stated condition without inventing a universal GPA threshold. Check whether a changed major, additional semester or preparatory year remains covered.",{"children":"Read the duration and renewal clause in each issued decision. Record credit load, academic progress, annual financial reassessment or any other stated condition without inventing a universal GPA threshold. Check whether a changed major, additional semester or preparatory year remains covered."}],["$","p","Build a year-by-year plan that separates committed support from conditional future support. If a scholarship decision is still pending, keep it out of the confirmed column. This is especially useful for a family deciding how much cash must be available before the first payment. A large advertised award can still leave a timing or renewal gap.",{"children":"Build a year-by-year plan that separates committed support from conditional future support. If a scholarship decision is still pending, keep it out of the confirmed column. This is especially useful for a family deciding how much cash must be available before the first payment. A large advertised award can still leave a timing or renewal gap."}]],"$undefined","$L25","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",